  clock: 2  # fb67
  nonce: fb67  # fb67
  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat4/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. Since fb3ad346f9 (2026-08-10) EXTERNAL_CONSTRUCTOR_TYPES is derived from python.yaml method-row owners, not hand-listed. Fixture: HTTPConnection.request is net_send, urlopen(...).read is net_recv (HTTPResponse), Popen.communicate is ipc_recv, so those asks are done. Still open: `c = sqlite3.connect(); c.execute()` is python:external:0-0:execute and unclassified; NamedTemporaryFile().write is typed but external_potential; with `from socket import socket as sk`, `sk().send` is untyped. open() mode precision is not done. MECHANISM: constructor map is derived from catalogue method-row owners, so a factory function's result and an unrowed owner type stay untyped/unclassified."  # fb67
